{
  "apiVersion": "openctem.io/interop/v1",
  "format": "sarif",
  "version": "2.1.0",
  "direction": "import",
  "namespace": "org.ctis.interop.sarif",
  "title": "SARIF 2.1.0",
  "source": "SARIF 2.1.0 (OASIS) as written by CodeQL, semgrep, trivy, gitleaks, betterleaks and other static analysis tools",
  "version_pointer": "/version",
  "detect": [{"pointer": "/version", "equals": "2.1.0", "or_absent": true}],
  "notes": [
    "The conversion is sarif.Import; through package importer the input limits apply and the importer chooses the asset.",
    "Asset: Options.Repository (a receiver sets it from a verified identity); else the first repository a run names in versionControlProvenance (repositoryUri without user info, branch, revisionId); else Options.DefaultAsset or an unclassified asset named after the tool, with an issue.",
    "Severity: the security-severity score (result, then rule), else the result level, else the rule's default level, else medium. Type: the rule's tags, a CVE/GHSA rule id, else the tool name. Options.ToolType (sast, sca, secret, iac, web3), when set, decides the type and the tool techniques instead.",
    "A secret scanner's region snippet is masked (ctis.MaskSecretMatch), and the raw value and each secret-looking word of it are masked in every other field: title, description, message, properties, tags and fingerprints.",
    "Fingerprint: the result's fingerprints entry with the lowest key (hashed above 64 characters); partialFingerprints pass through.",
    "Data flow: the first threadFlow with a location, of the first 10 codeFlows (10 threadFlows each), becomes findings[].data_flow; at most ctis.MaxDataFlowSteps steps, in order. A step's role comes from its kinds (source, sink, sanitizer), else its message (starts with Source, Sink or Propagator; says sanitized), else its position: the first unmarked step is the source and the last the sink when no step is marked so. A malformed trace leaves the finding without a data flow and never fails it.",
    "Data flow paths are repository-relative: a file URI or absolute path is made relative to the run's originalUriBaseIds or to the root a relative path of the same flow reveals, else dropped (the step is kept); a path leaving the repository is dropped. Credentials in step snippets and messages are masked (ctis.RedactCodeSecrets); a secret finding's raw match is masked in its data flow as everywhere else. The data flow never feeds the fingerprint."
  ],
  "records": [{"name": "result", "path": "/runs[]/results[]", "kind": "finding"}],
  "tables": {
    "baseline_state": {"map": {"absent": "absent", "new": "new", "unchanged": "unchanged", "updated": "updated"}},
    "level_severity": {"default": "medium", "map": {"error": "high", "none": "info", "note": "low", "warning": "medium"}, "match": "fold"},
    "precision_confidence": {"map": {"high": "85", "low": "50", "medium": "70", "very-high": "95"}},
    "result_kind": {"map": {"fail": "fail", "informational": "informational", "notapplicable": "not_applicable", "open": "open", "pass": "pass", "review": "review"}, "match": "token"}
  },
  "hooks": ["sarif.code_flows", "sarif.fingerprint", "sarif.provenance", "sarif.results", "sarif.rule_catalog", "sarif.rule_lookup", "sarif.rule_taxonomy", "sarif.severity", "sarif.suppressions", "sarif.web_exchange"],
  "fields": [
    {"path": "/$schema", "target": "(container)"},
    {"path": "/version", "target": "format check (only 2.1.0 is read)", "hook": "sarif.results"},
    {"path": "/runs", "target": "(container)"},
    {"path": "/runs[]", "target": "(container)"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/tool", "target": "(container)"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/tool/driver", "target": "(container)"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/tool/driver/name", "target": "tool.name, findings[].tool (several runs)", "hook": "sarif.results"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/tool/driver/version", "target": "tool.version", "hook": "sarif.results"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/tool/driver/semanticVersion", "target": "tool.version (when no version)", "hook": "sarif.results"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/tool/driver/informationUri", "target": "tool.info_url", "hook": "sarif.results"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/tool/driver/fullName", "ignored": "display name; name is kept"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/tool/driver/organization", "ignored": "the tool vendor's name; not a finding property"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/tool/driver/rules", "target": "(container)"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/tool/driver/rules[]", "target": "rules[] (each rule a result resolves to) and the rule of each result", "hook": "sarif.rule_lookup"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/tool/driver/rules[]/id", "target": "rules[].rule_id, findings[].rule_id (rule lookup)", "hook": "sarif.rule_lookup"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/tool/driver/rules[]/name", "target": "rules[].name, findings[].rule_name", "hook": "sarif.results"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/tool/driver/rules[]/shortDescription", "target": "(container)"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/tool/driver/rules[]/shortDescription/text", "target": "rules[].short_description, findings[].description, title (when the result has no message)", "hook": "sarif.results"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/tool/driver/rules[]/fullDescription", "target": "(container)"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/tool/driver/rules[]/fullDescription/text", "target": "rules[].full_description", "hook": "sarif.rule_catalog"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/tool/driver/rules[]/fullDescription/markdown", "ignored": "the markdown form of the description; the text is kept"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/tool/driver/rules[]/help", "target": "(container)"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/tool/driver/rules[]/help/text", "target": "rules[].help", "hook": "sarif.rule_catalog"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/tool/driver/rules[]/help/markdown", "ignored": "the markdown form of the help; the text is kept"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/tool/driver/rules[]/helpUri", "target": "rules[].help_uri (http and https only), findings[].references", "hook": "sarif.results"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/tool/driver/rules[]/defaultConfiguration", "target": "(container)"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/tool/driver/rules[]/defaultConfiguration/level", "target": "rules[].default_severity (when there is no security-severity), findings[].severity (when the result has no level)", "hook": "sarif.severity"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/tool/driver/rules[]/defaultConfiguration/enabled", "ignored": "tool configuration"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/tool/driver/rules[]/properties", "target": "(container)"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/tool/driver/rules[]/properties/tags", "target": "rules[].tags, findings[].tags, type, vulnerability.cwe_ids, owasp_ids", "hook": "sarif.rule_taxonomy"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/tool/driver/rules[]/properties/tags[]", "target": "rules[].tags, findings[].tags, type, vulnerability.cwe_ids, owasp_ids", "hook": "sarif.rule_taxonomy"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/tool/driver/rules[]/properties/precision", "target": "findings[].confidence", "hook": "sarif.results"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/tool/driver/rules[]/properties/security-severity", "target": "rules[].default_severity, findings[].severity", "hook": "sarif.severity"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/tool/driver/rules[]/properties/cwe", "target": "rules[].cwe_ids, findings[].vulnerability.cwe_ids", "hook": "sarif.rule_taxonomy"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/tool/driver/rules[]/properties/cwe[]", "target": "rules[].cwe_ids, findings[].vulnerability.cwe_ids", "hook": "sarif.rule_taxonomy"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/tool/driver/rules[]/properties/owasp", "target": "findings[].vulnerability.owasp_ids", "hook": "sarif.rule_taxonomy"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/tool/driver/rules[]/properties/owasp[]", "target": "findings[].vulnerability.owasp_ids", "hook": "sarif.rule_taxonomy"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/tool/driver/rules[]/properties/ctis_id", "target": "rules[].id (the CTIS rule id the exporter wrote, when it is a free document reference; else rule-N), findings[].rule_ref", "hook": "sarif.rule_catalog"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/tool/driver/rules[]/properties/*", "ignored": "other rule properties (CodeQL id, kind, name, description, problem.severity): duplicates of rule members or tool internals"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results", "target": "(container)"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]", "target": "findings[]", "hook": "sarif.results"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/ruleId", "target": "findings[].rule_id", "hook": "sarif.rule_lookup"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/ruleIndex", "target": "rule lookup", "hook": "sarif.rule_lookup"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/rule", "target": "(container)"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/rule/id", "target": "findings[].rule_id (when no ruleId)", "hook": "sarif.rule_lookup"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/rule/index", "target": "rule lookup", "hook": "sarif.rule_lookup"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/level", "target": "findings[].severity", "hook": "sarif.severity"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/kind", "target": "findings[].kind", "set": "kind", "record": "result", "transform": ["table:result_kind"]},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/baselineState", "target": "findings[].baseline_state", "set": "baseline_state", "record": "result", "transform": ["trim", "lower", "table:baseline_state"]},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/message", "target": "(container)"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/message/text", "target": "findings[].title (secrets masked)", "hook": "sarif.results"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/locations", "target": "(container)"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/locations[]", "target": "findings[].location (the first location)", "hook": "sarif.results"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/locations[]/physicalLocation", "target": "(container)"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/locations[]/physicalLocation/artifactLocation", "target": "(container)"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/locations[]/physicalLocation/artifactLocation/uri", "target": "findings[].location.path", "hook": "sarif.results"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/locations[]/physicalLocation/artifactLocation/uriBaseId", "ignored": "base of a relative uri on the scanning machine; the relative path is kept"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/locations[]/physicalLocation/artifactLocation/index", "ignored": "index into run.artifacts; the uri is kept"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/locations[]/physicalLocation/region", "target": "(container)"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/locations[]/physicalLocation/region/startLine", "target": "findings[].location.start_line", "hook": "sarif.results"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/locations[]/physicalLocation/region/endLine", "target": "findings[].location.end_line", "hook": "sarif.results"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/locations[]/physicalLocation/region/startColumn", "target": "findings[].location.start_column", "hook": "sarif.results"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/locations[]/physicalLocation/region/endColumn", "target": "findings[].location.end_column", "hook": "sarif.results"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/locations[]/physicalLocation/region/snippet", "target": "(container)"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/locations[]/physicalLocation/region/snippet/text", "target": "findings[].location.snippet (masked for secret scanners)", "hook": "sarif.results"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/locations[]/logicalLocations", "target": "(container)"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/locations[]/logicalLocations[]", "target": "(container)"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/locations[]/logicalLocations[]/name", "target": "findings[].location.logical_location.name", "hook": "sarif.results"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/locations[]/logicalLocations[]/fullyQualifiedName", "target": "findings[].location.logical_location.fully_qualified_name", "hook": "sarif.results"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/locations[]/logicalLocations[]/kind", "target": "findings[].location.logical_location.kind", "hook": "sarif.results"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/fingerprints", "target": "(container)"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/fingerprints/*", "target": "findings[].fingerprint (the lowest key)", "hook": "sarif.fingerprint"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/partialFingerprints", "target": "(container)"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/partialFingerprints/*", "target": "findings[].partial_fingerprints", "hook": "sarif.results"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/correlationGuid", "target": "findings[].correlation_id", "set": "correlation_id", "record": "result"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/suppressions", "target": "(container)"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/suppressions[]", "target": "findings[].suppression, status", "hook": "sarif.suppressions"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/suppressions[]/kind", "target": "findings[].suppression.kind", "hook": "sarif.suppressions"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/suppressions[]/status", "target": "findings[].suppression.status, status", "hook": "sarif.suppressions"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/suppressions[]/justification", "target": "findings[].suppression.justification", "hook": "sarif.suppressions"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/webRequest", "target": "findings[].evidence_items[http_exchange].http.request (capped, sensitive values marked)", "hook": "sarif.web_exchange"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/webRequest/protocol", "target": "findings[].evidence_items[].http.request.http_version", "hook": "sarif.web_exchange"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/webRequest/version", "target": "findings[].evidence_items[].http.request.http_version", "hook": "sarif.web_exchange"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/webRequest/target", "target": "findings[].evidence_items[].http.request.url", "hook": "sarif.web_exchange"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/webRequest/method", "target": "findings[].evidence_items[].http.request.method", "hook": "sarif.web_exchange"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/webRequest/headers", "target": "(container)"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/webRequest/headers/*", "target": "findings[].evidence_items[].http.request.headers[] (Authorization, Cookie and API-key values marked sensitive)", "hook": "sarif.web_exchange"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/webRequest/body", "target": "(container)"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/webRequest/body/text", "target": "findings[].evidence_items[].http.request.body", "hook": "sarif.web_exchange"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/webRequest/body/binary", "target": "findings[].evidence_items[].http.request.body (base64)", "hook": "sarif.web_exchange"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/webRequest/index", "ignored": "index into run.webRequests; the inline object is kept"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/webRequest/parameters", "ignored": "the request's parameters; the target URL and body hold them"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/webRequest/parameters/*", "ignored": "the request's parameters; the target URL and body hold them"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/webResponse", "target": "findings[].evidence_items[http_exchange].http.response (capped, sensitive values marked)", "hook": "sarif.web_exchange"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/webResponse/protocol", "target": "findings[].evidence_items[].http.response.http_version", "hook": "sarif.web_exchange"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/webResponse/version", "target": "findings[].evidence_items[].http.response.http_version", "hook": "sarif.web_exchange"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/webResponse/statusCode", "target": "findings[].evidence_items[].http.response.status", "hook": "sarif.web_exchange"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/webResponse/reasonPhrase", "target": "findings[].evidence_items[].http.response.reason", "hook": "sarif.web_exchange"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/webResponse/headers", "target": "(container)"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/webResponse/headers/*", "target": "findings[].evidence_items[].http.response.headers[] (Set-Cookie values marked sensitive)", "hook": "sarif.web_exchange"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/webResponse/body", "target": "(container)"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/webResponse/body/text", "target": "findings[].evidence_items[].http.response.body", "hook": "sarif.web_exchange"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/webResponse/body/binary", "target": "findings[].evidence_items[].http.response.body (base64)", "hook": "sarif.web_exchange"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/webResponse/noResponseReceived", "target": "findings[].evidence_items[].http.response (left out when true)", "hook": "sarif.web_exchange"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/webResponse/index", "ignored": "index into run.webResponses; the inline object is kept"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/properties", "target": "(container)"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/properties/tags", "target": "findings[].tags", "hook": "sarif.rule_taxonomy"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/properties/tags[]", "target": "findings[].tags", "hook": "sarif.rule_taxonomy"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/properties/tags[]/**", "ignored": "a tag that is not a string"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/properties/security-severity", "target": "findings[].severity", "hook": "sarif.severity"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/properties/*", "ignored": "other result properties (tool specific)"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/codeFlows", "target": "findings[].data_flow (the first threadFlow with a location)", "hook": "sarif.code_flows"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/codeFlows[]", "target": "(container)"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/codeFlows[]/message", "ignored": "the path's summary; each step keeps its own message"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/codeFlows[]/message/**", "ignored": "the path's summary; each step keeps its own message"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/codeFlows[]/properties", "ignored": "tool specific"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/codeFlows[]/properties/**", "ignored": "tool specific"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/codeFlows[]/threadFlows", "target": "(container)"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/codeFlows[]/threadFlows[]", "target": "findings[].data_flow (the first with a location)", "hook": "sarif.code_flows"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/codeFlows[]/threadFlows[]/id", "ignored": "thread id; one flow is kept"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/codeFlows[]/threadFlows[]/message", "ignored": "thread summary; each step keeps its own message"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/codeFlows[]/threadFlows[]/message/**", "ignored": "thread summary; each step keeps its own message"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/codeFlows[]/threadFlows[]/initialState", "ignored": "debugger state; not a step"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/codeFlows[]/threadFlows[]/initialState/**", "ignored": "debugger state; not a step"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/codeFlows[]/threadFlows[]/immutableState", "ignored": "debugger state; not a step"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/codeFlows[]/threadFlows[]/immutableState/**", "ignored": "debugger state; not a step"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/codeFlows[]/threadFlows[]/properties", "ignored": "tool specific"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/codeFlows[]/threadFlows[]/properties/**", "ignored": "tool specific"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/codeFlows[]/threadFlows[]/locations", "target": "(container)"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/codeFlows[]/threadFlows[]/locations[]", "target": "findings[].data_flow.sources[], intermediates[], sanitizers[] or sinks[] (in step order, index renumbered)", "hook": "sarif.code_flows"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/codeFlows[]/threadFlows[]/locations[]/kinds", "target": "findings[].data_flow.*[].type (source, sink, sanitizer)", "hook": "sarif.code_flows"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/codeFlows[]/threadFlows[]/locations[]/kinds[]", "target": "findings[].data_flow.*[].type (source, sink, sanitizer)", "hook": "sarif.code_flows"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/codeFlows[]/threadFlows[]/locations[]/location", "target": "(container)"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/codeFlows[]/threadFlows[]/locations[]/location/physicalLocation", "target": "(container)"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/codeFlows[]/threadFlows[]/locations[]/location/physicalLocation/artifactLocation", "target": "(container)"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/codeFlows[]/threadFlows[]/locations[]/location/physicalLocation/artifactLocation/uri", "target": "findings[].data_flow.*[].path (repository-relative; absolute runner paths dropped)", "hook": "sarif.code_flows"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/codeFlows[]/threadFlows[]/locations[]/location/physicalLocation/artifactLocation/uriBaseId", "ignored": "base of a relative uri on the scanning machine; the relative path is kept"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/codeFlows[]/threadFlows[]/locations[]/location/physicalLocation/artifactLocation/index", "ignored": "index into run.artifacts; the uri is kept"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/codeFlows[]/threadFlows[]/locations[]/location/physicalLocation/region", "target": "(container)"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/codeFlows[]/threadFlows[]/locations[]/location/physicalLocation/region/startLine", "target": "findings[].data_flow.*[].line", "hook": "sarif.code_flows"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/codeFlows[]/threadFlows[]/locations[]/location/physicalLocation/region/endLine", "target": "findings[].data_flow.*[].end_line", "hook": "sarif.code_flows"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/codeFlows[]/threadFlows[]/locations[]/location/physicalLocation/region/startColumn", "target": "findings[].data_flow.*[].column", "hook": "sarif.code_flows"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/codeFlows[]/threadFlows[]/locations[]/location/physicalLocation/region/endColumn", "target": "findings[].data_flow.*[].end_column", "hook": "sarif.code_flows"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/codeFlows[]/threadFlows[]/locations[]/location/physicalLocation/region/snippet", "target": "(container)"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/codeFlows[]/threadFlows[]/locations[]/location/physicalLocation/region/snippet/text", "target": "findings[].data_flow.*[].content (credentials masked)", "hook": "sarif.code_flows"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/codeFlows[]/threadFlows[]/locations[]/location/physicalLocation/region/**", "ignored": "other region members (char offsets, source language)"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/codeFlows[]/threadFlows[]/locations[]/location/logicalLocations", "target": "(container)"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/codeFlows[]/threadFlows[]/locations[]/location/logicalLocations[]", "target": "(container)"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/codeFlows[]/threadFlows[]/locations[]/location/logicalLocations[]/fullyQualifiedName", "target": "findings[].data_flow.*[].function", "hook": "sarif.code_flows"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/codeFlows[]/threadFlows[]/locations[]/location/logicalLocations[]/name", "target": "findings[].data_flow.*[].function (when no fullyQualifiedName)", "hook": "sarif.code_flows"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/codeFlows[]/threadFlows[]/locations[]/location/logicalLocations[]/**", "ignored": "other logical location members"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/codeFlows[]/threadFlows[]/locations[]/location/message", "target": "(container)"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/codeFlows[]/threadFlows[]/locations[]/location/message/text", "target": "findings[].data_flow.*[].label (credentials masked), step role", "hook": "sarif.code_flows"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/codeFlows[]/threadFlows[]/locations[]/location/**", "ignored": "other location members (id, annotations, relationships)"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/codeFlows[]/threadFlows[]/locations[]/**", "ignored": "other thread flow location members (nesting level, execution order, state, module, stack)"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/relatedLocations", "ignored": "secondary locations; the primary location is kept"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/results[]/relatedLocations[]/**", "ignored": "secondary locations; the primary location is kept"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/versionControlProvenance", "target": "(container)"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/versionControlProvenance[]", "target": "assets[] (when no repository is given)", "hook": "sarif.provenance"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/versionControlProvenance[]/repositoryUri", "target": "assets[].value (user info removed)", "hook": "sarif.provenance"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/versionControlProvenance[]/revisionId", "target": "assets[].properties.commit_sha", "hook": "sarif.provenance"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/versionControlProvenance[]/branch", "target": "assets[].properties.branch", "hook": "sarif.provenance"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/invocations", "ignored": "how the tool ran (command line, environment, exit code): scan operation details, may hold paths and arguments of the build machine"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/invocations[]/**", "ignored": "how the tool ran: scan operation details"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/artifacts", "ignored": "the files the tool read; findings name their own file"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/artifacts[]/**", "ignored": "the files the tool read; findings name their own file"},
    {"path": "/runs[]/originalUriBaseIds", "target": "roots stripped from absolute data flow paths (never stored)", "hook": "sarif.code_flows"},
